---
// Native HTML rendering of a FinBrio AI signal — crisp at any resolution,
// unlike a screenshot. Figures mirror the real in-app AAPL example so it's
// consistent with the hero phone (illustrative sample, not a live quote).
---

<div class="sigcard">
  <div class="sigcard__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="sigcard__head">
    <div>
      <div class="sigcard__ticker">Apple <span>AAPL</span></div>
      <div class="sigcard__tf">1D · Strategy S1</div>
    </div>
    <span class="sigcard__badge">BUY</span>
  </div>

  <div class="sigcard__conf">
    <div class="sigcard__conf-row">
      <span><span class="num">78</span>% confidence</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sigcard__bar"><span style="width: 78%"></span></div>
  </div>

  <svg class="sigcard__spark" viewBox="0 0 320 72" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="sparkFill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#00d4aa" stop-opacity="0.28" />
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#00d4aa" stop-opacity="0" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path
      d="M0,54 L26,50 L52,58 L78,44 L104,49 L130,36 L156,42 L182,28 L208,33 L234,20 L260,26 L286,12 L320,17 L320,72 L0,72 Z"
      fill="url(#sparkFill)"
    />
    <path
      d="M0,54 L26,50 L52,58 L78,44 L104,49 L130,36 L156,42 L182,28 L208,33 L234,20 L260,26 L286,12 L320,17"
      fill="none" stroke="#00d4aa" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"
    />
  </svg>

  <div class="sigcard__grid">
    <div class="sigcard__cell">
      <span class="sigcard__k">Entry</span>
      <span class="num sigcard__v">327.74</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sigcard__cell">
      <span class="sigcard__k">Stop loss</span>
      <span class="num sigcard__v sigcard__v--dn">315.32</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sigcard__cell">
      <span class="sigcard__k">Take profit</span>
      <span class="num sigcard__v sigcard__v--up">358.80</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sigcard__cell">
      <span class="sigcard__k">Risk : reward</span>
      <span class="num sigcard__v">2.50</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="sigcard__note">
    <span class="sigcard__dot"></span>
    RSI at 64.5 leans slightly bullish · price reclaimed the 50-day average.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .sigcard {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 22px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .sigcard__glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -14%;
    z-index: -1;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, rgba(0, 212, 170, 0.22), transparent 68%);
    filter: blur(26px);
  }

  .sigcard__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .sigcard__ticker {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .sigcard__ticker span {
    color: var(--text-faint);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  .sigcard__tf {
    margin-top: 3px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .sigcard__badge {
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--accent-dim-18);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .sigcard__conf {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .sigcard__conf-row {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 7px;
  }

  .sigcard__conf-row .num {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .sigcard__bar {
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sigcard__bar span {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #7ef7dd);
  }

  .sigcard__spark {
    width: 100%;
    height: 64px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .sigcard__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sigcard__cell {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .sigcard__k {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .sigcard__v {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .sigcard__v--up { color: var(--accent); }
  .sigcard__v--dn { color: var(--danger); }

  .sigcard__note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .sigcard__dot {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
